# Peticiones de prueba. En VS Code: extensión "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) → clic en "Send Request".
# En IntelliJ funciona sin extensión.
# Orden sugerido: 1) login  2) el resto usa el token automáticamente.

@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@today = 2026-09-30

### ─────────────────────────────── Auth ───────────────────────────────

### Registro
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "yo@ejemplo.com", "password": "cambia-esto-123", "fullName": "Mi Nombre" }

### Login (guarda el token para las siguientes peticiones)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "demo@planificacion.dev", "password": "demo12345" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Renovar el access token (el refresh token anterior queda invalidado)
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### Cerrar sesión
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### Mi usuario
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ──────────────────────── Disciplinas y planificación ────────────────────────

### Listar disciplinas
GET {{base}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear disciplina
# @name disciplina
POST {{base}}/disciplines
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Beber 2 L de agua", "icon": "💧", "description": "Tomar 2 litros durante el día" }

### Marcar como cumplida hoy
PUT {{base}}/planning/{{today}}/disciplines/{{disciplina.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desmarcar
DELETE {{base}}/planning/{{today}}/disciplines/{{disciplina.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Semana (lunes a domingo) con semáforo por día
GET {{base}}/planning?from=2026-09-28&to=2026-10-04
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────── Pendientes ───────────────────────────────

### Crear pendiente
# @name tarea
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Reparar la licuadora", "description": "Cambiar cuchillas", "priority": "HIGH", "deadline": "2026-10-05" }

### Activos (pendientes + en progreso)
GET {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Completados
GET {{base}}/tasks?status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambiar estado
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/{{tarea.response.body.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "IN_PROGRESS" }

### ─────────────────────────────── Finanzas ───────────────────────────────

### Actualizar tasa BCV
POST {{base}}/finance/rates/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tasa vigente
GET {{base}}/finance/rates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Entrada
POST {{base}}/finance/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "INCOME", "date": "{{today}}", "account": "ZELLE", "amount": 500, "incomeType": "SALARY", "description": "Quincena" }

### Salida (gasto)
POST {{base}}/finance/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "EXPENSE", "date": "{{today}}", "account": "PAGO_MOVIL", "amount": 20000,
  "expenseReason": "PURCHASE", "expenseClass": "EXPENSE", "category": "Comida", "description": "Mercado" }

### Venta de divisas: $100 Zelle → Bs Pago Móvil
POST {{base}}/finance/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}", "reason": "CURRENCY_SALE", "fromAccount": "ZELLE", "fromAmount": 100,
  "toAccount": "PAGO_MOVIL", "toAmount": 86000 }

### Compra de USDT con bolívares (la tasa de compra se calcula sola)
POST {{base}}/finance/exchanges
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}", "reason": "EXCHANGE", "fromAccount": "PAGO_MOVIL", "fromAmount": 30000,
  "toAccount": "USDT", "toAmount": 33 }

### Movimientos del mes
GET {{base}}/finance/movements?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumen: saldos, totales en $/Bs/€, mes y últimos 6 meses
GET {{base}}/finance/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ─────────────────────────────── Nutrición ───────────────────────────────

### Buscar alimentos (catálogo + propios)
GET {{base}}/nutrition/foods?q=pollo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar comida desde un alimento (usa el id de la búsqueda)
POST {{base}}/nutrition/diary/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}", "meal": "LUNCH", "foodId": "PEGA-AQUI-EL-ID", "amount": 200 }

### Registro rápido
POST {{base}}/nutrition/diary/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}", "meal": "SNACK", "name": "Empanada de queso", "protein": 8, "carbs": 30, "fat": 12 }

### Diario del día con % de cada macro
GET {{base}}/nutrition/diary?date={{today}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Peso y % de grasa
PUT {{base}}/nutrition/body
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "{{today}}", "weightKg": 78.4, "bodyFatPct": 18.6, "waistCm": 85 }

### Perfil
PUT {{base}}/nutrition/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sex": "MALE", "birthDate": "1999-05-10", "heightCm": 176, "activityLevel": "MODERATE", "goal": "RECOMPOSITION" }

### Plan recomendado
GET {{base}}/nutrition/plan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aplicar el plan como objetivos
POST {{base}}/nutrition/plan/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
